# 6. Shopify is now extremely aligned with this strategy

This has moved materially since our earlier discussions.

Shopify now automatically syndicates eligible products through **Shopify Catalog** to agentic storefronts, and it continuously supplies structured title, description, options, images, price and availability. ([Shopify Help Center][1])

Even better, every merchant has an agent-readable store endpoint.

Shopify now exposes a **Storefront Catalog MCP** implementing UCP:

```text
https://YOURSTORE.com/api/ucp/mcp
```

with:

```text
search_catalog
lookup_catalog
get_product
```

and buyer context fields such as country, language, currency and intent. ([Shopify][2])

This is almost tailor-made for Drop.

### It gives us our evaluation harness

After publishing a subgraph to Shopify:

```text
our canonical graph
       ↓
Shopify compiler
       ↓
store catalog
       ↓
/api/ucp/mcp
       ↓
50 adversarial buyer queries
```

Examples:

> replacement gearbox for 1998 NorDan balcony door, 35 mm backset

> old GU lock stamped 6-28740; what replaces it?

> does this 8 mm spindle fit my 1994 mechanism?

We can test **the actual agent-facing commerce representation**, not just our private database.

