# 10. ChatGPT discovery: Shopify does most of the plumbing for us

OpenAI says Shopify merchant data is integrated through Shopify Catalog. ChatGPT merchant selection uses factors including:

* availability;
* price;
* quality;
* maker/primary seller status. ([OpenAI Help Center][5])

So the moat is not:

> “stuff more keywords into the feed.”

It's:

```text
correct exact product
+ correct identifiers
+ rich attributes
+ live inventory
+ competitive price
+ merchant quality
+ evidence-rich PDP
```

OpenAI's March 2026 product-discovery announcement explicitly says Shopify Catalog is providing product data into ChatGPT's shopping system. ([OpenAI][6])

One catch:

**Shopify's current dedicated ChatGPT agentic-storefront eligibility requires the store to sell to US customers.** ([Shopify Help Center][7])

So for a Norway-only niche:

```text
PRIMARY:
Google / Gemini
Google Shopping/free listings
open-web ChatGPT discovery
our own store resolver

SECONDARY:
Shopify's explicit ChatGPT channel
```

unless we're legitimately willing to sell those SKUs to the US too.

Don't distort the business just to satisfy that checkbox.

