# 12. `question_and_answer` is exactly useful—but don't spam 30

Google supports up to **30 Q&As** with a total 10,000-character limit. ([Google Help][10])

Good questions:

> Does this replace GU 6-28740?

> Does it fit 35 mm backset models?

> Does it fit left- and right-handed doors?

> What measurements must I take before ordering?

> What does it explicitly not fit?

Bad Q&A:

> What is a door lock?

The compiler should generate only questions that disambiguate purchase decisions.

