# 13. Important correction about manuals

`document_link` is brilliant for this thesis—but Google says the merchant must have the rights to share the document for marketing purposes, and PDFs must be public/stable/crawlable. Up to five PDFs are supported. ([Google Help][11])

So do **not** indiscriminately ingest every OEM PDF into Merchant Center.

Store internally:

```text
OEM manual
service bulletin
exploded diagram
installation guide
```

but emit `document_link` only when usage rights are acceptable.

Also Google explicitly advises against duplicating the same facts across `document_link`, Q&A and `product_detail`. ([Google Help][10])

So don't do:

```text
100 details
+ 30 identical FAQs
+ same entire manual
```

just because limits exist.

Build a **field allocator**.

